      "id": 6615,
      "finding_type": "relationship",
      "summary": "Von Spakovsky moved from Heritage to Pence's AAF Edwin Meese III Institute Jan 2026: Resigned Heritage Dec 22, 2025 amid Heritage Foundation exodus (20+ board members/scholars/staffers left after Kevin Roberts Tucker Carlson controversy Oct 30). Joins 13 other former Heritage staff at AAF including directors of economic, legal, and data teams. AAF launched Edwin Meese III Institute for Rule of Law in Dec 2025. Von Spakovsky cited election integrity and immigration issues as key focus areas. Named Edwin Meese III as namesake - same name as Heritage center he left (Meese Center for Legal and Judicial Studies). This represents a Heritage election capability transplant to AAF, not a departure from the network.",
